&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Hands-on experience taking AI/LLM capabilities to production — agent orchestration, tool integration, retrieval, and evaluation/feedback loops that keep AI improving safely&lt;/li&gt;
